# Files `vercel deploy` must never upload from a local checkout.
#
# Vercel CLI does not apply .gitignore the way git does: `/data/*` with a
# `!/data/.gitkeep` re-include let the whole real data/ folder (account
# snapshots, P&L, bot trades) ride along as deployment source on every
# previous deploy. Confirmed via the deployment files API, not assumed.
# A demo build never renders it (NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE pins the fixtures),
# but real account data has no business sitting on a third-party host at
# all -- see SECURITY.md. Plain directory patterns, no negation, on
# purpose.
data/
.env*
!.env.docker.example
.next/
node_modules/
.vercel/
